damaged_code:
```cpp
// Running on single CPU core
while (lock_held) {
    // BUG: Spin loop consumes CPU! Lock holder cannot be scheduled 
    // to release the lock!
}
```

fix:
Introduce scheduling yields inside the spin loop, or use thread-blocking mutexes.
```cpp
while (lock_held) {
    std::this_thread::yield(); // Let other thread run to release
}
```
